      "content": "The board is actually pretty leaning towards the distributed approach anyway. They're concerned about the \"single point of failure\" risk of having one central intelligence managing everything. They want to move towards a system of 50 smaller, specialized local AI modules for the hubs to increase overall resilience. Can you draft a transition plan for how we'd phase out the central management system in favor of these localized modules?",
